{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46347","headline":"夏雨 · 齐己","name":"夏雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霮䨴蔽穹苍，冥蒙自一方。\n当时消酷毒，随处有清凉。\n着物声虽暴，滋农润即长。\n乍红萦急电，微白露残阳。\n应祷尤难得，经旬甚不妨。\n吟听喧竹树，立见涨池塘。\n衆类声休出，羣峰色尽藏。\n颓沱来洞壑，汗漫入潇湘。\n下叶黎甿望，高祛旱暵光。\n幽斋飘卧簟，极浦洒归樯。\n藓在堦从湿，花衰苑任伤。\n闲思济时力，謌咏发哀肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}